{"4916400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lemon Simulator", "steam_appid": 4916400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lemon Simulator is a unique experience where your main goal is to be a lemon and enjoy life surrounded by nature. Forget about dynamic battles and challenging quests. Here, you simply lie on the bank of a forest river, contemplating the flow of water and listening to the birds singing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Relaxation: No stress or deadlines. Just enjoy the atmosphere of a forest paradise and feel like a real lemon among the moss and ferns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Visuals: The game is permeated with soft sunlight filtering through the treetops, with reflections in the water and detailed forest vegetation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chilling Soundtrack: The sounds of the forest—the babbling river, birdsong, and rustling leaves—are complemented by specially selected calm music for deep relaxation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simplicity and Zen: This is the perfect simulator for those seeking peace and meditation in games. Observe life around you, and let the world revolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to become a lemon in this fairytale forest?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lemon Simulator is a unique experience where your main goal is to be a lemon and enjoy life surrounded by nature. Forget about dynamic battles and challenging quests. Here, you simply lie on the bank of a forest river, contemplating the flow of water and listening to the birds singing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Relaxation: No stress or deadlines. Just enjoy the atmosphere of a forest paradise and feel like a real lemon among the moss and ferns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Visuals: The game is permeated with soft sunlight filte